          "heading": "Federico Ruzza scores Italy's only try as Springboks win 66-7 in Turin",
          "body": "Ruzza's 61st-minute try, converted by Paolo Garbisi, was Italy's only score as South Africa ran in nine tries at Allianz Stadium. The world champions led 45-0 at the break, and Italy's afternoon worsened in the 30th minute when loosehead prop Muhamed Hasa was shown a yellow card for a deliberate knock-on. Coach Gonzalo Quesada's side were missing 16 players through injury, including captain Michele Lamaro."
