          "heading": "Archie Griffin scores early try as Wales trade blows with Japan",
          "body": "In Saturday's Japan test, Archie Griffin, back from injury and making his first Nations Championship appearance after missing the opening three rounds, powered over from a lineout maul in the fourth minute. Sam Costelow converted. Japan levelled inside 12 minutes, Ben Gunter finishing after Wales spilled a high ball in their own 22, and the teams were level at 7-7 by the 18th minute."
