          "kicker": "Talent versus team",
          "heading": "Andy Bull doubts Wallabies can knit talent into team against England",
          "body": "Writing in the Guardian ahead of Sunday's Test, Andy Bull says Australia have moments of brilliance but still lack a way to turn them into sustained form. Against England at Twickenham, Tom Wright starts at full-back, with Max Jorgensen and Joseph-Aukuso Suaalii on the wings and Len Ikitau back in midfield. Bull points to back-to-back Bledisloe Cup defeats to New Zealand, 31 points one week and 22 the next."
